Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 15:57:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(p6r): serve owned Tailnet ingress with machine fallback

Route the host's Tailnet Serve ingress through its own loopback listener while
keeping identity resolution best-effort. Verified people retain their identity;
requests without usable person evidence continue with a stable machine actor.
